[
  {
    "text": "Hello. Hello everyone. Good morning and",
    "start": 1.28,
    "duration": 6.68
  },
  {
    "text": "good day.",
    "start": 4.72,
    "duration": 3.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Joining here from uh Los Santos,",
    "start": 8.639,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "California.",
    "start": 11.759,
    "duration": 4.961
  },
  {
    "text": "And I'm joined by a Dharma colleague and",
    "start": 13.519,
    "duration": 7.281
  },
  {
    "text": "Dharma friend here in my own space here.",
    "start": 16.72,
    "duration": 6.639
  },
  {
    "text": "So I'm very delighted",
    "start": 20.8,
    "duration": 7.0
  },
  {
    "text": "um to be here.",
    "start": 23.359,
    "duration": 4.441
  },
  {
    "text": "And so this week we've been unfolding",
    "start": 28.4,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "this simile of crossing the flood.",
    "start": 30.56,
    "duration": 9.36
  },
  {
    "text": "Now here we are and the last day of this",
    "start": 35.12,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "week",
    "start": 39.92,
    "duration": 6.959
  },
  {
    "text": "and I was uh savoring the kind of um",
    "start": 41.84,
    "duration": 7.039
  },
  {
    "text": "flavor",
    "start": 46.879,
    "duration": 6.121
  },
  {
    "text": "flavor of this teaching",
    "start": 48.879,
    "duration": 4.121
  },
  {
    "text": "and There is the sense of",
    "start": 57.28,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "one step at a time.",
    "start": 61.039,
    "duration": 6.84
  },
  {
    "text": "One step at a time.",
    "start": 63.92,
    "duration": 3.959
  },
  {
    "text": "And so uh in this meditation",
    "start": 68.24,
    "duration": 7.68
  },
  {
    "text": "um the week started with stepping into",
    "start": 72.479,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "the flow, stepping into the flow of our",
    "start": 75.92,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
  {
    "text": "lives.",
    "start": 78.799,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "uh staying in the flow in the current",
    "start": 81.36,
    "duration": 7.759
  },
  {
    "text": "whether or not there are waves and",
    "start": 86.159,
    "duration": 5.841
  },
  {
    "text": "forces and floods.",
    "start": 89.119,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "And then we um",
    "start": 92.0,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "learn to stabilize ourselves by not",
    "start": 95.759,
    "duration": 5.201
  },
  {
    "text": "hurrying",
    "start": 99.2,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "and not freezing.",
    "start": 100.96,
    "duration": 7.839
  },
  {
    "text": "And yesterday uh we incorporated",
    "start": 105.2,
    "duration": 8.48
  },
  {
    "text": "attuning attuning to the effects of",
    "start": 108.799,
    "duration": 8.801
  },
  {
    "text": "um our practice our efforts and",
    "start": 113.68,
    "duration": 6.079
  },
  {
    "text": "sometimes we're going to overdo it.",
    "start": 117.6,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "Sometimes we might underdo it and then",
    "start": 119.759,
    "duration": 5.521
  },
  {
    "text": "we learn from",
    "start": 122.96,
    "duration": 5.359
  },
  {
    "text": "observing, feeling, sensing the effect",
    "start": 125.28,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "of it and having a deep trust.",
    "start": 128.319,
    "duration": 7.92
  },
  {
    "text": "uh there is a inner wisdom, inner",
    "start": 133.04,
    "duration": 6.559
  },
  {
    "text": "compassion, inner responsiveness",
    "start": 136.239,
    "duration": 7.161
  },
  {
    "text": "that is capable",
    "start": 139.599,
    "duration": 3.801
  },
  {
    "text": "of onwardly leading momentum.",
    "start": 143.76,
    "duration": 9.28
  },
  {
    "text": "So it can see, can hear, can can sense",
    "start": 147.599,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "the wholesome,",
    "start": 153.04,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "can find the way.",
    "start": 155.599,
    "duration": 7.121
  },
  {
    "text": "So today we will be practicing uh in",
    "start": 157.92,
    "duration": 8.24
  },
  {
    "text": "that kind of a territory.",
    "start": 162.72,
    "duration": 5.599
  },
  {
    "text": "And so",
    "start": 166.16,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "please join me",
    "start": 168.319,
    "duration": 7.761
  },
  {
    "text": "maybe um by starting with",
    "start": 171.04,
    "duration": 8.8
  },
  {
    "text": "just taking a few long deep breaths to",
    "start": 176.08,
    "duration": 6.159
  },
  {
    "text": "arrive.",
    "start": 179.84,
    "duration": 5.119
  },
  {
    "text": "Arrive at this moment",
    "start": 182.239,
    "duration": 6.28
  },
  {
    "text": "here and now.",
    "start": 184.959,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm going to ring bell to just to allow",
    "start": 191.84,
    "duration": 5.679
  },
  {
    "text": "you to also arrive arrive by writing",
    "start": 194.64,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "with the sound of the bell.",
    "start": 197.519,
    "duration": 6.381
  },
  {
    "text": "[Music]",
    "start": 199.6,
    "duration": 4.3
  },
  {
    "text": "Let the sound go.",
    "start": 210.0,
    "duration": 3.879
  },
  {
    "text": "Settling here.",
    "start": 214.239,
    "duration": 3.441
  },
  {
    "text": "settling now.",
    "start": 219.2,
    "duration": 4.2
  },
  {
    "text": "We are arriving",
    "start": 228.799,
    "duration": 3.481
  },
  {
    "text": "because we know the value",
    "start": 234.08,
    "duration": 8.68
  },
  {
    "text": "of being present for our lives.",
    "start": 237.12,
    "duration": 5.64
  },
  {
    "text": "We know the value",
    "start": 249.92,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "of getting centered",
    "start": 252.56,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "collected",
    "start": 256.32,
    "duration": 5.159
  },
  {
    "text": "around the sati.",
    "start": 257.84,
    "duration": 3.639
  },
  {
    "text": "Sometimes I hear this phrase from",
    "start": 269.12,
    "duration": 4.079
  },
  {
    "text": "teachers,",
    "start": 271.6,
    "duration": 6.599
  },
  {
    "text": "mindfulness front and center.",
    "start": 273.199,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Let yourself feel",
    "start": 282.32,
    "duration": 9.319
  },
  {
    "text": "the centeredness of being present.",
    "start": 286.08,
    "duration": 5.559
  },
  {
    "text": "And then mindfulness all around.",
    "start": 302.16,
    "duration": 5.72
  },
  {
    "text": "A kind of a pervasiveness",
    "start": 311.199,
    "duration": 3.881
  },
  {
    "text": "or expansiveness.",
    "start": 315.28,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "Let the presence",
    "start": 328.4,
    "duration": 8.12
  },
  {
    "text": "mindful presence presence get big.",
    "start": 330.479,
    "duration": 6.041
  },
  {
    "text": "So all kinds of experiences that's",
    "start": 343.44,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "happening here and now",
    "start": 346.4,
    "duration": 7.079
  },
  {
    "text": "can be received.",
    "start": 350.0,
    "duration": 3.479
  },
  {
    "text": "Sounds,",
    "start": 360.4,
    "duration": 5.16
  },
  {
    "text": "silence,",
    "start": 362.56,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "sensations in the body.",
    "start": 366.16,
    "duration": 4.2
  },
  {
    "text": "Breath.",
    "start": 371.919,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "We are unhurried,",
    "start": 394.56,
    "duration": 7.72
  },
  {
    "text": "not in a hurry.",
    "start": 398.4,
    "duration": 3.88
  },
  {
    "text": "Because the moment is here,",
    "start": 404.479,
    "duration": 8.761
  },
  {
    "text": "there is no need to hurry.",
    "start": 408.479,
    "duration": 4.761
  },
  {
    "text": "The next moment will come to you.",
    "start": 417.6,
    "duration": 5.4
  },
  {
    "text": "We are staying",
    "start": 429.28,
    "duration": 3.8
  },
  {
    "text": "learning to stay",
    "start": 433.199,
    "duration": 5.601
  },
  {
    "text": "here",
    "start": 436.319,
    "duration": 5.481
  },
  {
    "text": "now.",
    "start": 438.8,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Let the momentary",
    "start": 461.759,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "mindfulness",
    "start": 465.28,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "flow",
    "start": 467.919,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "into a flow",
    "start": 470.0,
    "duration": 7.8
  },
  {
    "text": "of mindful presence.",
    "start": 473.759,
    "duration": 4.041
  },
  {
    "text": "studying and stabilizing",
    "start": 488.0,
    "duration": 4.12
  },
  {
    "text": "in mindful awareness. Yes.",
    "start": 492.4,
    "duration": 4.359
  },
  {
    "text": "Quietly feeling and sensing.",
    "start": 512.56,
    "duration": 5.159
  },
  {
    "text": "coming inside",
    "start": 530.64,
    "duration": 6.28
  },
  {
    "text": "of your experience.",
    "start": 533.2,
    "duration": 3.72
  },
  {
    "text": "Like a dropping below",
    "start": 542.72,
    "duration": 7.559
  },
  {
    "text": "the surface level of the water.",
    "start": 545.519,
    "duration": 4.76
  },
  {
    "text": "There is a whole world",
    "start": 558.56,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "below the surface. Yes.",
    "start": 564.959,
    "duration": 4.201
  },
  {
    "text": "We are not in a hurry.",
    "start": 627.36,
    "duration": 4.44
  },
  {
    "text": "We are participating",
    "start": 635.92,
    "duration": 3.72
  },
  {
    "text": "with energy,",
    "start": 642.24,
    "duration": 6.68
  },
  {
    "text": "vitality",
    "start": 645.92,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "and we can feel the aliveness of the",
    "start": 650.72,
    "duration": 6.6
  },
  {
    "text": "process.",
    "start": 654.32,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "It may touch your heart,",
    "start": 661.2,
    "duration": 4.04
  },
  {
    "text": "tender,",
    "start": 679.6,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "maybe refreshing.",
    "start": 684.16,
    "duration": 3.48
  },
  {
    "text": "There is a heightened",
    "start": 705.2,
    "duration": 4.879
  },
  {
    "text": "attunement",
    "start": 708.0,
    "duration": 5.8
  },
  {
    "text": "to your experience.",
    "start": 710.079,
    "duration": 3.721
  },
  {
    "text": "So you can feel",
    "start": 720.399,
    "duration": 5.961
  },
  {
    "text": "the ease",
    "start": 722.959,
    "duration": 3.401
  },
  {
    "text": "or the strength.",
    "start": 727.68,
    "duration": 3.48
  },
  {
    "text": "You just know this intuitively.",
    "start": 735.04,
    "duration": 5.08
  },
  {
    "text": "And right here,",
    "start": 751.68,
    "duration": 8.839
  },
  {
    "text": "maybe there is some degrees of a choice",
    "start": 754.72,
    "duration": 5.799
  },
  {
    "text": "to relax and soften",
    "start": 761.279,
    "duration": 6.36
  },
  {
    "text": "the strain,",
    "start": 764.32,
    "duration": 3.319
  },
  {
    "text": "the striving. thing.",
    "start": 770.079,
    "duration": 3.801
  },
  {
    "text": "The wholesome qualities may bubble up.",
    "start": 795.68,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "energetic a joy",
    "start": 813.76,
    "duration": 4.04
  },
  {
    "text": "or sweet happiness.",
    "start": 825.36,
    "duration": 3.96
  },
  {
    "text": "peaceful",
    "start": 841.04,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "or not so peaceful.",
    "start": 854.24,
    "duration": 3.959
  },
  {
    "text": "Seeing and knowing clearly",
    "start": 880.48,
    "duration": 7.28
  },
  {
    "text": "feels like this.",
    "start": 884.079,
    "duration": 3.681
  },
  {
    "text": "When we're not being identified",
    "start": 1252.24,
    "duration": 9.319
  },
  {
    "text": "by our experiences,",
    "start": 1257.679,
    "duration": 3.88
  },
  {
    "text": "You may feel",
    "start": 1267.36,
    "duration": 6.799
  },
  {
    "text": "a kind of still",
    "start": 1270.4,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "flowing",
    "start": 1274.159,
    "duration": 6.121
  },
  {
    "text": "movement within.",
    "start": 1276.48,
    "duration": 3.8
  },
  {
    "text": "Ajanga likes to point to",
    "start": 1282.24,
    "duration": 5.16
  },
  {
    "text": "still",
    "start": 1287.84,
    "duration": 4.76
  },
  {
    "text": "flowing.",
    "start": 1289.6,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "There is a stillness",
    "start": 1296.08,
    "duration": 3.719
  },
  {
    "text": "and there is a movement.",
    "start": 1301.679,
    "duration": 4.041
  },
  {
    "text": "And this is step by step training",
    "start": 1813.6,
    "duration": 7.959
  },
  {
    "text": "practicing.",
    "start": 1818.559,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "May whatever degrees of goodness,",
    "start": 1822.24,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "benefits",
    "start": 1826.159,
    "duration": 4.561
  },
  {
    "text": "support our own hearts and minds and",
    "start": 1828.24,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "bodies.",
    "start": 1830.72,
    "duration": 8.28
  },
  {
    "text": "And may it support all beings.",
    "start": 1833.44,
    "duration": 5.56
  },
  {
    "text": "[Music]",
    "start": 1843.2,
    "duration": 11.799
  },
  {
    "text": "Thank you friends for practicing",
    "start": 1868.799,
    "duration": 5.641
  },
  {
    "text": "together.",
    "start": 1871.44,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "As I was reflecting about uh this suta",
    "start": 1875.039,
    "duration": 6.161
  },
  {
    "text": "that I've been sharing crossing the",
    "start": 1879.12,
    "duration": 4.64
  },
  {
    "text": "flood",
    "start": 1881.2,
    "duration": 6.479
  },
  {
    "text": "uh as a whole kind of in the totality of",
    "start": 1883.76,
    "duration": 5.519
  },
  {
    "text": "it",
    "start": 1887.679,
    "duration": 6.641
  },
  {
    "text": "the flavor of this whole suta",
    "start": 1889.279,
    "duration": 8.4
  },
  {
    "text": "evokes a kind of a flavor you know it's",
    "start": 1894.32,
    "duration": 7.44
  },
  {
    "text": "this steady step by step",
    "start": 1897.679,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "crossing the flood",
    "start": 1901.76,
    "duration": 5.279
  },
  {
    "text": "And sometimes uh the Buddha would",
    "start": 1904.399,
    "duration": 5.841
  },
  {
    "text": "describe the practice journey or",
    "start": 1907.039,
    "duration": 8.64
  },
  {
    "text": "practice path as a gradual training",
    "start": 1910.24,
    "duration": 8.159
  },
  {
    "text": "and so it's gradual",
    "start": 1915.679,
    "duration": 7.281
  },
  {
    "text": "and can't be hurried you know unhuring",
    "start": 1918.399,
    "duration": 7.041
  },
  {
    "text": "and untaring.",
    "start": 1922.96,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "So it's a a stepbystep",
    "start": 1925.44,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "alive process",
    "start": 1927.76,
    "duration": 7.039
  },
  {
    "text": "and it invites us uh to meet the moment",
    "start": 1930.32,
    "duration": 8.4
  },
  {
    "text": "and respond to the moment as best as we",
    "start": 1934.799,
    "duration": 5.521
  },
  {
    "text": "can",
    "start": 1938.72,
    "duration": 4.24
  },
  {
    "text": "with wisdom and compassion.",
    "start": 1940.32,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "And that's no small thing. That's no",
    "start": 1942.96,
    "duration": 6.599
  },
  {
    "text": "small thing.",
    "start": 1946.24,
    "duration": 3.319
  },
  {
    "text": "And also embedded in this simile,",
    "start": 1950.96,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm going to put things together a",
    "start": 1955.76,
    "duration": 3.519
  },
  {
    "text": "little bit.",
    "start": 1957.6,
    "duration": 4.559
  },
  {
    "text": "There's a whole sense of crossing the",
    "start": 1959.279,
    "duration": 5.041
  },
  {
    "text": "flood.",
    "start": 1962.159,
    "duration": 7.041
  },
  {
    "text": "There is a sense of direction.",
    "start": 1964.32,
    "duration": 8.64
  },
  {
    "text": "Can you feel that? There is a sense of",
    "start": 1969.2,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "direction.",
    "start": 1972.96,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "In other sutas, uh sometimes the Buddha",
    "start": 1974.72,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "would speak about the nearshore and the",
    "start": 1977.84,
    "duration": 8.64
  },
  {
    "text": "far shore. And the far shore is said to",
    "start": 1981.84,
    "duration": 7.28
  },
  {
    "text": "be a sanctuary.",
    "start": 1986.48,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "And we have to cross the flood to get to",
    "start": 1989.12,
    "duration": 5.279
  },
  {
    "text": "the far shore that is peaceful and",
    "start": 1991.36,
    "duration": 6.039
  },
  {
    "text": "sublime.",
    "start": 1994.399,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And so this crossing the flood",
    "start": 1997.76,
    "duration": 10.039
  },
  {
    "text": "um has a directional orientation",
    "start": 2001.919,
    "duration": 5.88
  },
  {
    "text": "and it's with this directional",
    "start": 2008.32,
    "duration": 4.079
  },
  {
    "text": "orientation",
    "start": 2010.88,
    "duration": 5.679
  },
  {
    "text": "that we are not disoriented by the",
    "start": 2012.399,
    "duration": 7.441
  },
  {
    "text": "forces of greed, hatred, delusion, by",
    "start": 2016.559,
    "duration": 6.641
  },
  {
    "text": "the flood, by the current.",
    "start": 2019.84,
    "duration": 7.199
  },
  {
    "text": "And this is quite significant",
    "start": 2023.2,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "because I know for me as a lay",
    "start": 2027.039,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
