    "duration": 8.64
  },
  {
    "text": "possibility of choosing not grasping",
    "start": 2436.4,
    "duration": 10.56
  },
  {
    "text": "ending uh craving for ourselves",
    "start": 2442.16,
    "duration": 8.88
  },
  {
    "text": "and for others. That's the possibility.",
    "start": 2446.96,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "That's the possibility. That's the",
    "start": 2451.04,
    "duration": 4.64
  },
  {
    "text": "perspective guiding us.",
    "start": 2452.88,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "And then the wise intention",
