    "duration": 8.799
  },
  {
    "text": "brahabiharaas kindness compassion",
    "start": 2481.119,
    "duration": 4.48
  },
  {
    "text": "And so this orientation",
    "start": 2487.599,
    "duration": 7.681
  },
  {
    "text": "can begin to guide us uh in some way.",
    "start": 2491.04,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "And even if at times it's not so clear,",
    "start": 2495.28,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
