    "text": "it's not always that we know you know",
    "start": 2498.0,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "what the appropriate response is for",
    "start": 2500.72,
    "duration": 6.84
  },
  {
    "text": "specific situations.",
    "start": 2503.92,
    "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
    "text": "It is important for us to keep that",
    "start": 2508.079,
    "duration": 8.04
  },
  {
    "text": "reflection in our hearts and minds",
    "start": 2511.28,
    "duration": 4.839
  },
