    "start": 2519.599,
    "duration": 5.601
  },
  {
    "text": "clarified over time.",
    "start": 2522.4,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "And so again even in helping us to",
    "start": 2525.2,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "clarify our directional sense the",
    "start": 2528.56,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "directional orientation",
    "start": 2531.68,
    "duration": 6.159
  },
  {
    "text": "uh is not to be rushed.",
    "start": 2534.56,
    "duration": 7.519
  },
  {
    "text": "And I was very touched by uh when Gil uh",
    "start": 2537.839,
    "duration": 8.961
  },
  {
    "text": "shared that uh in uh in his journey at",
    "start": 2542.079,
    "duration": 8.401
  },
