    "text": "one time he had to spend the whole year",
    "start": 2546.8,
    "duration": 7.92
  },
  {
    "text": "reflecting about his intentions.",
    "start": 2550.48,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "So, we're not in a huge rush here,",
    "start": 2554.72,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "but it is important",
    "start": 2558.48,
    "duration": 8.56
  },
  {
    "text": "for us to get a sense of direction, a",
