    "text": "sense of orientation",
    "start": 2567.04,
    "duration": 5.96
  },
  {
    "text": "uh in us.",
    "start": 2569.599,
    "duration": 3.401
  },
  {
    "text": "And so this wise intention and uh wise",
    "start": 2573.44,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "view and wise uh intention as it becomes",
    "start": 2576.64,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "more and more clear",
    "start": 2580.96,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "what happens is",
    "start": 2583.52,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "we can begin to have a sense of wise",
    "start": 2586.24,
    "duration": 7.68
  },
  {
    "text": "livelihood. How do we want to live?",
    "start": 2590.16,
    "duration": 8.36
  },
  {
    "text": "Wise speech wise action.",
    "start": 2593.92,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "It doesn't mean that somehow magically",
    "start": 2599.119,
    "duration": 5.841
  },
  {
    "text": "we will immediately be able to just",
    "start": 2602.24,
    "duration": 7.96
  },
  {
    "text": "choose the right word appropriate word",
    "start": 2604.96,
    "duration": 5.24
  },
  {
    "text": "but we know with that orientation",
    "start": 2610.56,
    "duration": 7.44
  },
  {
    "text": "it helps uh begin to create a wholesome",
    "start": 2614.8,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "container.",
    "start": 2618.0,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "So as best as we can this began began to",
    "start": 2619.52,
    "duration": 7.16
  },
  {
    "text": "be a training",
    "start": 2623.28,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "and then in deepening this whole process",
    "start": 2627.04,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "and it's it's depicted as a wheel and",
    "start": 2630.079,
    "duration": 8.321
  },
  {
    "text": "that through deepening our uh meditative",
    "start": 2633.92,
    "duration": 9.84
  },
  {
    "text": "and daily life practices with um uh wise",
    "start": 2638.4,
    "duration": 9.919
  },
  {
    "text": "effort, wise mindfulness, wise samadei",
    "start": 2643.76,
    "duration": 6.079
  },
  {
    "text": "Our",
    "start": 2648.319,
    "duration": 4.241
  },
  {
    "text": "wise view get more and more clear, our",
    "start": 2649.839,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "wise intention get more and more clear.",
    "start": 2652.56,
    "duration": 7.48
  },
  {
    "text": "And so in this way",
    "start": 2656.079,
    "duration": 3.961
  },
  {
    "text": "it's a gradual training. It's this wheel",
    "start": 2660.319,
    "duration": 6.561
  },
  {
    "text": "keep turning, keep turning and keep",
    "start": 2663.04,
    "duration": 6.84
  },
  {
    "text": "turning",
    "start": 2666.88,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "and guess it's where it's all happening.",
    "start": 2670.8,
    "duration": 7.64
  },
  {
    "text": "It's here and now.",
    "start": 2674.4,
    "duration": 4.04
  },
  {
    "text": "And so I'd like to end um this whole",
    "start": 2678.48,
    "duration": 6.879
  },
  {
    "text": "sequence by reading uh from Dancing with",
    "start": 2681.52,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Life book that I read a few um quotes",
    "start": 2685.359,
    "duration": 9.201
  },
  {
    "text": "from in this week. So here it is.",
    "start": 2689.52,
    "duration": 8.96
  },
  {
    "text": "Each step on your journey is complete in",
    "start": 2694.56,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
  {
    "text": "itself.",
    "start": 2698.48,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
  {
    "text": "Thus, finding fulfillment in living your",
    "start": 2700.0,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "intention is not dependent on your",
    "start": 2703.92,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "reaching your goal. Rather, each moment",
    "start": 2707.2,
    "duration": 8.639
